OL,3,GNEWSACouncil takes government to court
OL,4,Aover planning row
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses in Worcestershire are
OL,7,Ftaking the government to the High Court
OL,8,Fafter they were stripped of their
OL,9,Fpowers to vote on big planning
OL,10,Fapplications.
OL,12,FWychavon District Council's leadership
OL,13,Fdescribed the sanction as "outrageous"
OL,14,Fand said it wanted to set a legal
OL,15,Fprecedent by winning the case.
OL,17,FIt said a two-day hearing would take
OL,18,Fplace in December in a bid to overturn
OL,19,Fthe punishment, which was introduced in
OL,20,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
